# Docker builds (server/Dockerfile) only need the API server, the seed data,
# the demo parts and the app's content files (served as content packs) —
# keep the Flutter app, audio and build output out.
*
!server/
!seed/data/
!assets/demo/parts/
!assets/demo/demo_data.json
!assets/content/
server/node_modules
server/.env
server/dist
